pictures: the game's copy holds each to 1024 px on its longer side, and the largest went up at 2048 x 2048; spawn upload '/workspace/tripo5/maid.glb' --full-size keeps them at their own size, only when the creator asks
facing: not read (no rig to read it from); with no forward, the file's −Z is its front
origin: the engine stands this model with its lowest point on the object's feetPosition. Its lowest point is 0.875 m under the file's origin at the file's own size, so the origin draws 0.875 m straight above the feetPosition, the point the object turns about by default. model.offset: [0, -0.875, 0] draws the origin on the feetPosition.
